[%-
  # ── Your library: change the values on these two lines only. ───────────────────────────────────────────
  USE Koha;
  library_name = Koha.Preference('LibraryName') || "Your library";  # Koha does not say which library: type your name in quotes
  footer_note  = "";                 # one line under the signature, e.g. your opening hours; "" = none
-%]
Hello,

We received a request to set a new password for the library account [% user %]. Open this address to choose one:

[% passwordreseturl %]

The link works for 2 days. If you did not ask for this, ignore this message: your password stays as it is.

Thank you,
[% library_name %]
[% IF footer_note %][% footer_note %][% END %]
